<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE reference PUBLIC "-//OASIS//DTD DITA 1.3 Reference//EN" "reference.dtd">
<reference id="t00280">
	<title>Instrument cluster messages</title>
	<prolog>
		<metadata>
			<keywords>
				<indexterm>driving the hybrid/plug-in hybrid vehicle
					<indexterm>LCD display messages</indexterm>
				</indexterm>
			</keywords>
		</metadata>
	</prolog>
	<refbody>
		<section id="e01755">
			<title>Ready to drive</title>
			<table outputclass="formatc_none" frame="none" rowsep="0" colsep="0" id="e01756">
				<tgroup cols="2" colsep="0" rowsep="0">
					<colspec colnum="1" colname="col1" colwidth="2.343*" colsep="0"/>
					<colspec colnum="2" colname="col2" colwidth="2.343*" colsep="0"/>
					<tbody>
						<row rowsep="0">
							<entry colname="col1">
								<fig id="e01757">
									<image href="images/OLQ2AH005009.jpg" scale="95" align="center" placement="break"/>
								</fig>
							</entry>
							<entry colname="col2">
								<ol outputclass="callout" id="e01758">
									<li>
										<p><uicontrol>Ready to drive</uicontrol></p>
									</li>
								</ol>
							</entry>
						</row>
					</tbody>
				</tgroup>
			</table>
			<p>This message displays when the vehicle is ready to drive.</p>
		</section>
		<section id="e01759">
			<title>Check regenerative brakes</title>
			<table outputclass="formatc_none" frame="none" rowsep="0" colsep="0" id="e01760">
				<tgroup cols="2" colsep="0" rowsep="0">
					<colspec colnum="1" colname="col1" colwidth="2.343*" colsep="0"/>
					<colspec colnum="2" colname="col2" colwidth="2.343*" colsep="0"/>
					<tbody>
						<row rowsep="0">
							<entry colname="col1">
								<fig id="e01761">
									<image href="images/OLQ2AH005010.jpg" scale="95" align="center" placement="break"/>
								</fig>
							</entry>
							<entry colname="col2">
								<ol outputclass="callout" id="e01762">
									<li>
										<p><uicontrol>Check regenerative brakes</uicontrol></p>
									</li>
								</ol>
							</entry>
						</row>
					</tbody>
				</tgroup>
			</table>
			<p>This message displays when the brake performance is low or regenerative braking does not work properly due to a failure in the brake system. Operating the brake pedal might be slower than usual. The required braking distance might increase.</p>
		</section>
		<section id="e01763">
			<title>Stop vehicle and check regenerative brakes</title>
			<table outputclass="formatc_none" frame="none" rowsep="0" colsep="0" id="e01764">
				<tgroup cols="2" colsep="0" rowsep="0">
					<colspec colnum="1" colname="col1" colwidth="2.343*" colsep="0"/>
					<colspec colnum="2" colname="col2" colwidth="2.343*" colsep="0"/>
					<tbody>
						<row rowsep="0">
							<entry colname="col1">
								<fig id="e01765">
									<image href="images/OLQ2AH005011.jpg" scale="95" align="center" placement="break"/>
								</fig>
							</entry>
							<entry colname="col2">
								<ol outputclass="callout" id="e01766">
									<li>
										<p><uicontrol>Stop vehicle and check regenerative brakes</uicontrol></p>
									</li>
								</ol>
							</entry>
						</row>
					</tbody>
				</tgroup>
			</table>
			<p>This message displays when the brake system has a failure. In this case, park the vehicle in a safe location and have it towed to the nearest authorized Kia dealership or service partner to be inspected.</p>
		</section>
		<section id="e01767">
			<title>Check Hybrid system</title>
			<table outputclass="formatc_none" frame="none" rowsep="0" colsep="0" id="e01768">
				<tgroup cols="2" colsep="0" rowsep="0">
					<colspec colnum="1" colname="col1" colwidth="2.343*" colsep="0"/>
					<colspec colnum="2" colname="col2" colwidth="2.343*" colsep="0"/>
					<tbody>
						<row rowsep="0">
							<entry colname="col1">
								<fig id="e01769">
									<image href="images/OLQ2AH005012.jpg" scale="95" align="center" placement="break"/>
								</fig>
							</entry>
							<entry colname="col2">
								<ol outputclass="callout" id="e01770">
									<li>
										<p><uicontrol>Check Hybrid system</uicontrol></p>
									</li>
								</ol>
							</entry>
						</row>
					</tbody>
				</tgroup>
			</table>
			<p>This message displays when the hybrid control system has a problem. When this warning message displays, refrain from driving the vehicle. Have your vehicle inspected by a professional workshop. Kia recommends visiting an authorized Kia dealer or service partner.</p>
		</section>
		<section id="e01771">
			<title>Check Hybrid system. Stop safely.</title>
			<table outputclass="formatc_none" frame="none" rowsep="0" colsep="0" id="e01772">
				<tgroup cols="2" colsep="0" rowsep="0">
					<colspec colnum="1" colname="col1" colwidth="2.343*" colsep="0"/>
					<colspec colnum="2" colname="col2" colwidth="2.343*" colsep="0"/>
					<tbody>
						<row rowsep="0">
							<entry colname="col1">
								<fig id="e01773">
									<image href="images/OLQ2AH005013.jpg" scale="95" align="center" placement="break"/>
								</fig>
							</entry>
							<entry colname="col2">
								<ol outputclass="callout" id="e01774">
									<li>
										<p><uicontrol>Check Hybrid system. Stop safely.</uicontrol></p>
									</li>
								</ol>
							</entry>
						</row>
					</tbody>
				</tgroup>
			</table>
			<p>This message displays when the hybrid control system has a problem. The <term translate="no">READY</term> indicator blinks and a warning chime sounds until the problem resolves. When this warning message displays, refrain from driving the vehicle. Have your vehicle inspected by a professional workshop. Kia recommends visiting an authorized Kia dealer or service partner.</p>
		</section>
		<section id="e01775">
			<title>Check Hybrid system. Do not start engine.</title>
			<table outputclass="formatc_none" frame="none" rowsep="0" colsep="0" id="e01776">
				<tgroup cols="2" colsep="0" rowsep="0">
					<colspec colnum="1" colname="col1" colwidth="2.343*" colsep="0"/>
					<colspec colnum="2" colname="col2" colwidth="2.343*" colsep="0"/>
					<tbody>
						<row rowsep="0">
							<entry colname="col1">
								<fig id="e01777">
									<image href="images/OLQ2AH005014.jpg" scale="95" align="center" placement="break"/>
								</fig>
							</entry>
							<entry colname="col2">
								<ol outputclass="callout" id="e01778">
									<li>
										<p><uicontrol>Check Hybrid system. Do not start engine.</uicontrol></p>
									</li>
								</ol>
							</entry>
						</row>
					</tbody>
				</tgroup>
			</table>
			<p>This message displays when the hybrid battery’s charge level (SOC) is low. A warning chime sounds until the problem resolves. When this warning message displays, refrain from driving the vehicle. Have your vehicle inspected by a professional workshop. Kia recommends visiting an authorized Kia dealer or service partner.</p>
		</section>
		<section id="e01779">
			<title>Stop vehicle and check power supply</title>
			<table outputclass="formatc_none" frame="none" rowsep="0" colsep="0" id="e01780">
				<tgroup cols="2" colsep="0" rowsep="0">
					<colspec colnum="1" colname="col1" colwidth="2.343*" colsep="0"/>
					<colspec colnum="2" colname="col2" colwidth="2.343*" colsep="0"/>
					<tbody>
						<row rowsep="0">
							<entry colname="col1">
								<fig id="e01781">
									<image href="images/OLQ2AH005015.jpg" scale="95" align="center" placement="break"/>
								</fig>
							</entry>
							<entry colname="col2">
								<ol outputclass="callout" id="e01782">
									<li>
										<p><uicontrol>Stop vehicle and check power supply</uicontrol></p>
									</li>
								</ol>
							</entry>
						</row>
					</tbody>
				</tgroup>
			</table>
			<p>This message displays when the power supply system has a failure. In this case, park the vehicle in a safe location and have it towed to the nearest authorized Kia dealership or service partner to be inspected.</p>
		</section>
		<section id="e01783">
			<title>Check Virtual Engine Sound System</title>
			<table outputclass="formatc_none" frame="none" rowsep="0" colsep="0" id="e01784">
				<tgroup cols="2" colsep="0" rowsep="0">
					<colspec colnum="1" colname="col1" colwidth="2.343*" colsep="0"/>
					<colspec colnum="2" colname="col2" colwidth="2.343*" colsep="0"/>
					<tbody>
						<row rowsep="0">
							<entry colname="col1">
								<fig id="e01785">
									<image href="images/OLQ2AH005016.jpg" scale="95" align="center" placement="break"/>
								</fig>
							</entry>
							<entry colname="col2">
								<ol outputclass="callout" id="e01786">
									<li>
										<p><uicontrol>Check Virtual Engine Sound System</uicontrol></p>
									</li>
								</ol>
							</entry>
						</row>
					</tbody>
				</tgroup>
			</table>
			<p>This message displays when the Virtual Engine Sound System (VESS) has a problem. When this warning message displays, have your vehicle inspected by a professional workshop. Kia recommends visiting an authorized Kia dealer or service partner.</p>
		</section>
		<section id="e01787">
			<title>Refill coolant</title>
			<table outputclass="formatc_none" frame="none" rowsep="0" colsep="0" id="e01788">
				<tgroup cols="2" colsep="0" rowsep="0">
					<colspec colnum="1" colname="col1" colwidth="2.343*" colsep="0"/>
					<colspec colnum="2" colname="col2" colwidth="2.343*" colsep="0"/>
					<tbody>
						<row rowsep="0">
							<entry colname="col1">
								<fig id="e01789">
									<image href="images/OLQ2AH005017.jpg" scale="95" align="center" placement="break"/>
								</fig>
							</entry>
							<entry colname="col2">
								<ol outputclass="callout" id="e01790">
									<li>
										<p><uicontrol>Refill coolant</uicontrol></p>
									</li>
								</ol>
							</entry>
						</row>
					</tbody>
				</tgroup>
			</table>
			<p>This message displays when the inverter coolant is nearly empty. Refill the inverter coolant.</p>
		</section>
		<section id="e01791">
			<title>Park with engine On to charge battery</title>
			<table outputclass="formatc_none" frame="none" rowsep="0" colsep="0" id="e01792">
				<tgroup cols="2" colsep="0" rowsep="0">
					<colspec colnum="1" colname="col1" colwidth="2.343*" colsep="0"/>
					<colspec colnum="2" colname="col2" colwidth="2.343*" colsep="0"/>
					<tbody>
						<row rowsep="0">
							<entry colname="col1">
								<fig id="e01793">
									<image href="images/OLQ2AH005018.jpg" scale="95" align="center" placement="break"/>
								</fig>
							</entry>
							<entry colname="col2">
								<ol outputclass="callout" id="e01794">
									<li>
										<p><uicontrol>Park with engine On to charge battery</uicontrol></p>
									</li>
								</ol>
							</entry>
						</row>
					</tbody>
				</tgroup>
			</table>
			<p>This message displays when the hybrid battery’s charge level (SOC) is low. Park the vehicle in a safe location and wait for the hybrid battery to charge before you resume driving.</p>
		</section>
		<section id="e01795">
			<title>Start engine to avoid battery discharge</title>
			<table outputclass="formatc_none" frame="none" rowsep="0" colsep="0" id="e01796">
				<tgroup cols="2" colsep="0" rowsep="0">
					<colspec colnum="1" colname="col1" colwidth="2.343*" colsep="0"/>
					<colspec colnum="2" colname="col2" colwidth="2.343*" colsep="0"/>
					<tbody>
						<row rowsep="0">
							<entry colname="col1">
								<fig id="e01797">
									<image href="images/OLQ2AH005019.jpg" scale="95" align="center" placement="break"/>
								</fig>
							</entry>
							<entry colname="col2">
								<ol outputclass="callout" id="e01798">
									<li>
										<p><uicontrol>Start engine to avoid battery discharge</uicontrol></p>
									</li>
								</ol>
							</entry>
						</row>
					</tbody>
				</tgroup>
			</table>
			<p>This message displays when the 12V battery might discharge if the <term translate="no">ENGINE START/STOP</term> button is in the <term translate="no">ON</term> position and the <term translate="no">READY</term> indicator does not display. To prevent the 12V battery from discharging, set the vehicle to the <term translate="no">READY</term> mode.</p>
		</section>
	</refbody>
